@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
@courseId = REPLACE_WITH_OWN_COURSE_UUID
@assignmentId = REPLACE_WITH_OWN_ASSIGNMENT_UUID
@studySessionId = REPLACE_WITH_STUDY_SESSION_UUID
@version = 0

### GET list — empty [] is normal for an account with no saved plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/study-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Independent plan
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/study-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "assignmentId": null,
  "title": "Ôn tập Java",
  "startsAt": "2026-10-30T19:00:00+07:00",
  "timeZone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "notes": "Đọc tài liệu chương 3"
}

### Linked plan — make sure the assignment deadline is not earlier than this end
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/study-sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "assignmentId": "{{assignmentId}}",
  "title": "Làm báo cáo Java",
  "startsAt": "2026-10-30T20:00:00+07:00",
  "timeZone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "status": "PLANNED",
  "notes": "Hoàn thiện phần kết luận"
}

### Read actual current version
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/study-sessions/{{studySessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Combined filters — +07:00 must be encoded
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/study-sessions?courseId={{courseId}}&from=2026-10-30T18:00:00%2B07:00&to=2026-10-30T23:59:00%2B07:00&status=PLANNED
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Full replacement; null assignmentId detaches a linked plan
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/study-sessions/{{studySessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseId": "{{courseId}}",
  "assignmentId": null,
  "title": "Ôn Java — cập nhật",
  "startsAt": "2026-10-30T19:00:00+07:00",
  "timeZone": "Asia/Ho_Chi_Minh",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "notes": "Thời lượng mới; không ghi nhận Pomodoro",
  "version": {{version}}
}

### Re-read version before deleting; never use an old version by assumption
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/study-sessions/{{studySessionId}}?version={{version}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
